{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"区间"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"区间"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>直接定义</h3>\n<p>区间是如下的单类型"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚理论","text":"凝聚理论"}},{"Plain":"的模型:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\vdash (0\\leq 1)$;</li>\n<li>$\\vdash (0\\leq x)\\land (x\\leq 1)$;</li>\n<li>$(x\\leq y) \\land (y\\leq z) \\vdash (x\\leq z)$;</li>\n<li>$(x\\leq y) \\land (y\\leq x) \\vdash (x=y)$;</li>\n<li>$(0=1)\\vdash\\bot$ (有时人们也不加这一条, 而称满足这条公式的区间为<strong>严格区间</strong>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>通过语法范畴</h3>\n<p>区间的语法范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"单纯形范畴"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\Delta = \\{[0],[1],[2],\\cdots\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 中的<strong>区间</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"单纯形范畴"}},{"Plain":"到 $\\mathcal C$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦函子","text":"平坦函子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>另一种等价的说法是, $\\mathsf{Set}$ 中的区间是有限全序集的"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":"; 区间的范畴是 $\\Delta$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"ind-对象","text":"Ind-"}},{"Local":{"url":"余完备化","text":"完备化"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>区间的"},{"Local":{"url":"分类意象","text":"分类意象"}},{"Plain":"是"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯集","text":"单纯集"}},{"Plain":"的意象.</p>\n"}]}}